<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 26 December <span class="n">7</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/philip-i-of-taranto"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/philip-i-of-taranto.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Philip I of Taranto</span><span class="tp">1278–1331</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/niccolo-iii-deste"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/niccolo-iii-deste.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Niccolò III d'Este</span><span class="tp">1383–1441</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/arthur-iii-duke-of-brittany"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/arthur-iii-duke-of-brittany.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Arthur III, Duke of Brittany</span><span class="tp">1393–1458</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/galeazzo-maria-sforza"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/galeazzo-maria-sforza.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Galeazzo Maria Sforza</span><span class="tp">1444–1476</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/heinrich-schliemann"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/heinrich-schliemann.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Heinrich Schliemann</span><span class="tp">1822–1890</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/desmond-tutu"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/desmond-tutu.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Desmond Tutu</span><span class="tp">1931–2021</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/manmohan-singh"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Manmohan Singh</span><span class="tp">1932–2024</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
